# Mazemind Tome's "When there are four or more page counters on this artifact, exile it. If you do, you gain 4 life", with
# the Tome gone before it resolves. Its ruling: "If Mazemind Tome leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on
# the stack, you can't exile it from the zone it's put into." Bot1 puts the fourth page counter on turn 7 and Bot2, in
# response to the trigger, returns the Tome to Bot1's hand with Prismari Charm: the card in hand is a new object (CR
# 400.7), so the trigger exiles nothing and, as nothing was exiled, Bot1 gains no life (CR 608.2c). The scry under it
# still happens.

